    model", 2023), licensed CC BY-NC 4.0.

    NOTE: CC BY-NC 4.0 permits NON-COMMERCIAL use only. That restriction
    applies to the BN records regardless of the Apache-2.0 licence
    covering this project's code. See DATA_CARD.md.

  * Indirect prompt injection corpus — NOT distributed. It is reconstructed
    locally by scripts/build_xpia_corpus.py from three public agent-injection
    benchmarks, each under its own upstream terms (fetched by the user):
      - BIPIA          MIT; Yi et al. 2023   (https://github.com/microsoft/BIPIA)
      - LLMail-Inject  MIT; Microsoft        (https://huggingface.co/datasets/microsoft/llmail-inject-challenge)
      - InjecAgent     MIT; Zhan et al. 2024 (https://github.com/uiuc-kang-lab/InjecAgent)
    The assembly follows M. Fomin, "When Benchmarks Lie" (arXiv:2602.14161) and
    the loaders in https://github.com/maxf-zn/prompt-mining (MIT, (c) Zenity /
    Z Labs). None of the upstream prompt text is redistributed here.

